{%- doc -%}
  页面Title
  组成规则:
  1. 显示当前页面标题 page_title，示例：Jackery Best Solar Generators, Portable Power Stations & Solar Panels
  2. 如果是博客标签页, 添加 "- tagged xxx"，示例：Buying Advice Blogs - Jackery – tagged "Product Guide"
  3. 如果不是第一页, 添加 "- Page x"，示例：Search: 22 results found for "3000" – Page 2 – Jackery
  4. 如果页面标题不包含商店名称, 添加 "- 商店名称"，示例：Solar Generators - Jackery
{%- enddoc -%}

{% capture title %}
  {{ page_title }}
  {%- if current_tags %}
    &ndash; tagged "{{ current_tags | join: ', ' }}"
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if current_page != 1 %}
    &ndash; Page {{ current_page -}}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- unless page_title contains shop.name %}
    &ndash; {{ shop.name -}}
  {%- endunless -%}
{% endcapture %}

<title>
  {{- title | strip | strip_newlines -}}
</title>